# Buddy v2.0, rocker-bogie 6WD, steering servo on all four corners. ArduPilot Rover 4.5+.
# Set up as a normal car (Throttle 70 + GroundSteering 26). All four DS3225 get the same
# steering signal and the rear pair is reversed, so the back steers opposite the front and the
# turn radius roughly halves. Middle wheels are fixed. All 6 motors get the same throttle.
# It can't turn on the spot; if that matters, use buddy_6wd_skidsteer_alt.parm.
# Wheels in the air first. Set each servo's MIN/TRIM/MAX by hand so the knuckle never hits its stop.
FRAME_CLASS     1
FRAME_TYPE      0
# steering, MAIN 1-4
SERVO1_FUNCTION 26     # front left
SERVO2_FUNCTION 26     # front right
SERVO3_FUNCTION 26     # rear left
SERVO4_FUNCTION 26     # rear right
SERVO3_REVERSED 1
SERVO4_REVERSED 1
SERVO1_MIN 1100
SERVO1_TRIM 1500
SERVO1_MAX 1900
SERVO2_MIN 1100
SERVO2_TRIM 1500
SERVO2_MAX 1900
SERVO3_MIN 1100
SERVO3_TRIM 1500
SERVO3_MAX 1900
SERVO4_MIN 1100
SERVO4_TRIM 1500
SERVO4_MAX 1900
# throttle, MAIN 5-7: one output per dual FSESC, Y-cable to both of its PPM inputs
SERVO5_FUNCTION 70
SERVO6_FUNCTION 70
SERVO7_FUNCTION 70
SERVO5_MIN 1000
SERVO5_TRIM 1500
SERVO5_MAX 2000
SERVO6_MIN 1000
SERVO6_TRIM 1500
SERVO6_MAX 2000
SERVO7_MIN 1000
SERVO7_TRIM 1500
SERVO7_MAX 2000
# lights, MAIN 8: RC8 passed straight through to the light_controller
SERVO8_FUNCTION 58     # RCIN8
MOT_PWM_TYPE    0
MOT_THR_MAX     60
MOT_SLEWRATE    50
CRUISE_SPEED    1.0
CRUISE_THROTTLE 30
WP_SPEED        1.0
TURN_RADIUS     0.6    # guess from CAD, measure a full-lock circle and fix
ATC_STR_RAT_MAX 90
ATC_TURN_MAX_G  0.3
PIVOT_TURN_ANGLE 0     # no pivot turns, it's not skid-steer
# ExpressLRS over CRSF
SERIAL6_PROTOCOL 23
RC_PROTOCOLS    1
MODE_CH         5
MODE1           0
MODE2           0
MODE3           4
MODE4           4
MODE5           15
MODE6           11
RC7_OPTION      31     # motor e-stop switch, on top of the physical button
# ports
SERIAL1_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL1_BAUD    57
SERIAL2_PROTOCOL 2
SERIAL2_BAUD    921
# failsafes
FS_ACTION       2
FS_TIMEOUT      1.5
FS_THR_ENABLE   1
FS_THR_VALUE    910
FS_GCS_ENABLE   1
FS_CRASH_CHECK  1
BATT_MONITOR    4
BATT_CAPACITY   20000  # 2 packs. 3 = 30000, 4 = 40000. buddy/rover.py rewrites it from BUDDY_BATT_PACKS
BATT_LOW_VOLT   13.6
BATT_CRT_VOLT   13.2
BATT_FS_LOW_ACT 2
BATT_FS_CRT_ACT 2
ARMING_CHECK    1
ARMING_REQUIRE  1
